d={
'b2-panama-01':C('The Jungle Without a Road','You are Meg. You and Carlos are watching a documentary about the Darién, and he asks what you learned about the Pan-American Highway.','Tell Carlos what happens to the highway in the Darién.',['Say that the highway runs along almost the whole continent','Say that it stops in the Darién'],'La Carretera Panamericana, que recorre casi todo el continente, se interrumpe en el Darién.','The Pan-American Highway, which runs along almost the whole continent, stops in the Darién.','I can describe the isthmus and the Darién with relative clauses (*que*, *quien*).'),
'b2-panama-02':C('Before the Canal','You are Carlos. You and Meg are reading an article about the Panama Canal, and she asks you how ships travelled before it existed.','Tell Meg what ships had to do before the canal existed.',['Say what ships had to do','Say that this was before the canal existed'],'Antes de que existiera el canal, los barcos tenían que rodear América del Sur.','Before the canal existed, ships had to sail round South America.','I can say what happened before or after an event in the history of the canal, with *antes de que* and *después de que*.'),
'b2-panama-03':C('Essential but Paid Less','You are Meg. You and Carlos are listening to a talk about the Afro-Antillean workers of the canal, and he asks you what struck you most.','Tell Carlos what you noticed about the workers on the silver list.',['Say that their work was essential','Say that they were paid less'],'Si bien su trabajo era esencial, los trabajadores de la lista de plata cobraban menos.','Although their work was essential, the workers on the silver list were paid less.','I can grant a point in a formal sentence with *si bien* and the indicative.'),
'b2-panama-04':C('What Is Sold in Colón','You are Carlos. You and Meg are reading an article about Panama\'s economy, and she asks what the Colón Free Zone is for.','Tell Meg what happens to goods in the Colón Free Zone.',['Say that goods are sold there','Say that they are later re-exported'],'En la Zona Libre de Colón se venden mercancías que luego se reexportan a otros países.','In the Colón Free Zone goods are sold which are later re-exported to other countries.','I can say what is sold, used or published in Panama with the *se* passive.'),
'b2-panama-05':C('However Much the Sea Rises','You are Meg. You and Carlos are watching a report about Gardi Sugdub, and he asks what the scientists say about the sea.','Tell Carlos what will happen to the sea level, whatever happens to emissions.',['Say however much emissions fall','Say that the sea level will keep rising'],'Por más que bajen las emisiones, el nivel del mar seguirá subiendo.','However much emissions fall, the sea level will keep rising.','I can say that nothing changes however much something happens, with *por más que* and *por mucho que*.'),
'b2-panama-consolidation':C('Panama in Review','You are Carlos. You and Meg are preparing a short talk about Panama, and you want to give her one example of what you will say about the canal.','Tell Meg what the canal does and who has had it since 1999.',['Say that the canal joins two oceans','Say that it has been in Panama\'s hands since 1999'],'El canal, que une dos océanos, está en manos de Panamá desde 1999.','The canal, which joins two oceans, has been in Panama\'s hands since 1999.','I can describe a place or a person with *que* and *quien*.'),
}
